#: ../pwntools/docs/source/filepointer.rst:7
msgid ":mod:`pwnlib.filepointer` --- `FILE*` structure exploitation"
msgstr ":mod:`pwnlib.filepointer` --- `FILE*` 構造体のエクスプロイト"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer:1
msgid "File Structure Exploitation"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer:3
msgid "struct FILE (_IO_FILE) is the structure for File Streams. This offers various targets for exploitation on an existing bug in the code. Examples - ``_IO_buf_base`` and ``_IO_buf_end`` for reading data to arbitrary location."
msgstr "struct FILE (_IO_FILE) は、ファイルストリームを表す構造体です。コードに既存のバグがある場合に、さまざまな攻撃対象になります。例: ``_IO_buf_base`` と ``_IO_buf_end`` による任意の場所へのデータ読み込み。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer:7
msgid "Remembering the offsets of various structure members while faking a FILE structure can be difficult, so this python class helps you with that. Example-"
msgstr "FILE 構造体を偽造するときに各メンバーのオフセットを覚えておくのは大変なので、この Python のクラスがそれを助けます。例:"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer:17
msgid ""
"Now payload contains the FILE structure with its vtable pointer pointing "
"to 0xcafebabe"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer:19
msgid "Currently only 'amd64' and 'i386' architectures are supported"
msgstr "現在サポートしているアーキテクチャは 'amd64' と 'i386' だけです。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure:1
msgid "Crafts a FILE structure, with default values for some fields, like _lock which should point to null ideally, set."
msgstr "FILE 構造体を作成します。一部のフィールド(たとえば、本来は null を指すべき _lock)には既定値を設定します。"

#: ../pwntools/docs/source/filepointer.rst of
#: pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.orange
#: pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.read
#: pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.struntil
#: pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.write pwnlib.filepointer._update_var
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure:3
msgid "A pointer to NULL value in memory. This pointer can lie in any segment (stack, heap, bss, libc etc)"
msgstr "メモリ上の NULL 値へのポインタです。このポインタは、どのセグメント(スタック、ヒープ、bss、libc など)にあってもかまいません。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure:7 pwnlib.filepointer._update_var:10
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure:8
msgid ""
"FILE structure with flags as 0xfbad1807 and _IO_buf_base and _IO_buf_end "
"pointing to 0xcafebabe and 0xfacef00d"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure:20
msgid "Check the length of the FileStructure"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure:25
msgid "The definition for __repr__ orders the structure members and displays then in a dictionary format. It's useful when viewing a structure objet in python/IPython shell"
msgstr "__repr__ の定義は、構造体のメンバーを並べ替えて、辞書の形式で表示します。python/IPython シェルで構造体オブジェクトを確認するときに便利です。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure:63
msgid "Bytes fields are padded to the correct field size. For example, _unused2 is 40 bytes on i386, so a short value gets zero-padded to 40, not to context.bytes (4):"
msgstr "バイト列のフィールドは、正しいフィールドサイズになるようパディングされます。たとえば、_unused2 は i386 では 40 バイトなので、短い値は context.bytes (4) ではなく 40 バイトまでゼロで埋められます。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.__repr__:1
msgid "Return repr(self)."
msgstr "repr(self) を返します。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.__setattr__:1
#: pwnlib.filepointer._FlagsUnionBase.__setattr__:1
msgid "Implement setattr(self, name, value)."
msgstr "setattr(self, name, value) を実装します。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.orange:1
msgid "Perform a House of Orange (https://github.com/shellphish/how2heap/blob/master/glibc_2.23/house_of_orange.c), provided you have libc leaks."
msgstr "libc のリークがある場合に、House of Orange (https://github.com/shellphish/how2heap/blob/master/glibc_2.23/house_of_orange.c) を実行します。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.orange:3
msgid "Address of _IO_list_all in libc."
msgstr "libc 内の _IO_list_all のアドレスです。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.orange:5
msgid "Address of the fake vtable in memory"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.orange:9
#: pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.read:9
#: pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.struntil:7
#: pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.write:9
msgid "Example"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.orange:10
msgid "Example payload if address of _IO_list_all is 0xfacef00d and fake vtable is at 0xcafebabe -"
msgstr "_IO_list_all のアドレスが 0xfacef00d で、偽の vtable が 0xcafebabe にある場合のペイロードの例です。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.read:1
msgid "Reading data into arbitrary memory location."
msgstr "任意のメモリ位置へのデータ読み込みです。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.read:3
msgid "The address into which data is to be written from stdin"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.read:5
msgid "The size, in bytes, of the data to be written"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.read:10
msgid "Payload for reading 100 bytes from stdin into the address 0xcafebabe"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.struntil:1
msgid "Payload for stuff till 'v' where 'v' is a structure member. This payload includes 'v' as well."
msgstr "'v'(構造体のメンバー)までのペイロードです。このペイロードには 'v' も含まれます。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.struntil:3
msgid "The name of the field uptil which the payload should be created."
msgstr "ペイロードを作成する最後のフィールドの名前です。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.struntil:8
msgid "Payload for data uptil _IO_buf_end"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.struntil:16
msgid "The returned payload includes the whole of the final field ``v``, so its length is the sum of the field sizes up to and including ``v``:"
msgstr "返されるペイロードには最後のフィールド ``v`` 全体が含まれるので、長さは ``v`` までの(``v`` を含む)フィールドサイズの合計になります。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.write:1
msgid "Writing data out from arbitrary memory address."
msgstr "任意のメモリアドレスからのデータ書き出しです。"

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.write:3
msgid "The address from which data is to be printed to stdout"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.write:5
msgid "The size, in bytes, of the data to be printed"
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.filepointer.FileStructure.write:10
msgid "Payload for writing 100 bytes to stdout from the address 0xcafebabe"
msgstr ""

